se (MGD): from genes to mice-a community resource for mouse biology</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2005</year><fpage>D471</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15608240</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Naf</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Krupke</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Sundberg</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Eppig</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name><name><surname>Bult</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Mouse Tumor Biology Database: a public resource for cancer genetics and pathology of the mouse</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>62</volume><fpage>1235</fpage><lpage>40</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11888882</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schofield</surname><given-names>PN</given-names></name><name><surname>Bard</surname><given-names>JBL</given-names></name><name><surname>Booth</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Boniver</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Covelli</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Delvenne</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Ellender</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Engstrom</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Goessner</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Gruenberger</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoefler</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hopewell</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Mancuso</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mothersill</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Potten</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Quintanilla-Fend</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Rozell</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Sariola</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Sundberg</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Ward</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pathbase: a database of mutant mouse pathology</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2004</year><fpage>D512</fpage><lpage>D515</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/nar/gkh124"/><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14681470</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/nar/gkh124</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ching</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooke</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Tarantino</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lapp</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Data and animal management software for large-scale phenotype screening</article-title><source>Mamm Genome</source><year>2006</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>288</fpage><lpage>297</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16596450</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00335-005-0145-5</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Baker</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Galloway</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmoyer</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Snoddy</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>MuTrack: a genome analysis system for large-scale mutagenesis in the mouse</arti